// BILLOWS UPWARD into rounded, sunlit cauliflower lobes. So the base cards sit low (oz≈0), wide and
// heavily SQUASHED (yScale→0.4) and DARK (litBias→0.1); the body lobes rise (oz+) and brighten; the
