  //
  // ⚠ THE DEPTH PASS IS BUILT HERE AND BLITTED BELOW THE GROUND LIGHT, NOT HERE. Everything on the
  // ROAD — the contact shadow, the lifter wash, the thrust cones — is painted before the model so
