  // canvas work and `collect` returns long before them: a bogey without them is a plain grey shape
  // with no propeller disc, no canopy glass, no nav lamps and no exhaust, which on an aeroplane is
  // most of what you are looking at (measured: 677 px and a 57×26 silhouette down to 131 px and
  // 41×14). So the pass still RUNS — it is what stamps `seen`, and `seen` is what stops a face
