      //
      // There were four of them, painted as plain white discs straight onto the 2-D canvas, and in
      // a GLASS 2 frame all four were composited over before anybody saw them (72 of 72 ops issued
      // before the blit — the measurement is on emitGroundLate). So a night airfield had no lights
      // at all, which is what it looked like.
      //
      // ⚠ THE SPACING IS FOR LEGIBILITY AND NOT TO SCALE, and it is worth saying so rather than
      // pretending. Real edge lights stand 60 m apart; a tile here is about 15 m, so to scale this
