      // got was a hairline with a step under it. 0.021 is a chunky 300 mm kerb: still a size a
      // real street has, and now wide enough to be a surface facing the sky. The one place a
      // number here is allowed to be generous, for the reason the manhole is.
      const KERB_HW = 0.021;
      // `only` restricts it to one side of the arm, for the one caller that has already drawn the
