//
// ⚠ PARKED IS NOT ABSENT, AND THAT IS THE WHOLE INTERFACE. The parts go on drawing at their home
// pose whatever this answers, so the off-switch gives you a crane standing still rather than a
// tower with its jib deleted — and the capture sees the same structure the live frame does, which
// is what stops the two disagreeing about where anything is. Every cycle below therefore has to
