// and so are the gaps, which is what tells a welder from a beacon — `blinkLight`'s own sine is a
// perfectly regular pulse, and a welder that keeps time reads as a navigation light.
// ⚠ IT MODULATES A LAMP AND NEVER THE FRAME. This is a few pixels of light on one building, and
// nothing here may grow into a full-screen flash — the same no-strobe rule the drug FX are held to.
