// It was three flat fills: a top at the raw palette colour, and two sides on one grey multiplier
// that bottomed out at 0.44. So a crane's machinery house was a full-strength yellow lid with a
// near-black flank under it and no gradient anywhere — the brightest thing in the frame beside the
// darkest, with a hard line between, which is what cut-out card looks like. Reported as the yellow
