// ⚠ THE KIT HUNG ITS SIGNS WITH NO IDEA WHAT WAS ON THE FRONTAGE, AND THE ARITHMETIC ALWAYS SAID
// SO. A corner blade goes at `main.hw * 0.84 - bw` and the glazing band reaches `main.hw * 0.76`,
